#ASSERT NOT `a lower position §8(א) of 16.9.2020 allows` TRUE (15%) 1 4.5 8.5
#ASSERT NOT `a lower position §8(א) of 16.9.2020 allows` TRUE 0.5 1 4 9
#ASSERT `the special compensation of 16.9.2020` 10000 1 1 0.5 EQUALS 3500
#ASSERT `the pension position of a lower position, of 16.9.2020` 0.5 1 EQUALS 0.85
#ASSERT `another day of 16.9.2020 keeps the weekly quota` 42 42.5
#ASSERT NOT `a shift supplement in the period of 16.9.2020` FALSE

